# Patches that ship, in apply order. One file name per line; '#' starts a comment.
# build/prepare.sh applies exactly these and fails on any other file in patches/
# (EDR patch-series). A change here is a patch-queue change: security review + records.
# Test-only hooks never go in patches/: they belong to the test harness.
#
# Reserved number ranges (one owner each; build/apply-patches.sh fails if two patches share a
# number):
#   0001-0004, 0012-0014   fork base
#   0005-0011, 0030-0034   RPC capability filter
#   0015-0029              secure agentic experiences
#   0035-0039              document and config sync
#   0040-0049              fork build
0001-build-skip-copilot-shim-without-extension.patch
0002-extensionkind-product-default.patch
0003-no-workspace-extensions-in-local-windows.patch
0004-extension-description-computed-fields-win.patch
# 0005-0011 are reserved for the RPC capability-filter series (anticomputer-rpc-filter-patches).
0012-background-windows-env.patch
0013-no-local-agent-host.patch
0014-build-desktop-without-copilot-runtime.patch
# 0015 onwards: the secure-agentic-experiences series (plan section 10).
# New files in 0015 are edited in agentic/patch-src (agentic/tools/sync-patch.ts).
0015-seclab-ahp-gate.patch
# 0030-0034 are reserved for the RPC sessions.
0035-seclab-document-sync-provenance.patch
# Fork build: Restart Extension Host re-resolves a managed (seclab+) authority (EDR ext-host-restart-reresolve).
0040-reresolve-managed-authority-on-restart.patch
# Fork build, interim until 0041 (main-process routing, ADR route-folder-opens-in-main) lands: no
# automatic tasks or their prompt in a local window.
0042-no-automatic-tasks-in-local-windows.patch
